§ `Beard Tax Act`

-- Jason Morris's Beard Tax Act as shipped in Lexpedite/blawx v1.6.22-alpha
-- (blawx/static/blawx/examples/beard_tax.yaml): only s.1, the definition.
-- His ontology: category person; attributes facial_hair_length_mm (number),
-- facial_hair_on_chin / facial_hair_below_chin / facial_hair_continuous (boolean
-- inputs), qualifies_s1a / qualifies_s1b / bearded (boolean, derived).

DECLARE Person HAS
    `facial hair length mm`  IS A NUMBER
    `facial hair on chin`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `facial hair below chin` IS A BOOLEAN
    `facial hair continuous` IS A BOOLEAN

@export 1. In this Act, beard means any facial hair no shorter than 5 millimetres in length that: (a) occurs on or below the chin, or (b) exists in an uninterrupted line from the front of one ear to the front of the other ear below the nose.
GIVEN p IS A Person
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `bearded` IF
        p's `facial hair length mm` AT LEAST 5
    AND (`qualifies s1a` p OR `qualifies s1b` p)

@export 1(a): facial hair that occurs on or below the chin.
GIVEN p IS A Person
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `qualifies s1a` IF
       p's `facial hair on chin`
    OR p's `facial hair below chin`

@export 1(b): facial hair that exists in an uninterrupted line from the front of one ear to the front of the other ear below the nose.
GIVEN p IS A Person
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `qualifies s1b` IF
    p's `facial hair continuous`

-- 6 mm on the chin
#EVAL `bearded` (Person WITH `facial hair length mm` IS 6, `facial hair on chin` IS TRUE, `facial hair below chin` IS FALSE, `facial hair continuous` IS FALSE)
-- L4 oracle ==> TRUE

-- 4 mm on the chin: too short
#EVAL `bearded` (Person WITH `facial hair length mm` IS 4, `facial hair on chin` IS TRUE, `facial hair below chin` IS FALSE, `facial hair continuous` IS FALSE)
-- L4 oracle ==> FALSE

-- 5 mm exactly, continuous line only: limb (b)
#EVAL `bearded` (Person WITH `facial hair length mm` IS 5, `facial hair on chin` IS FALSE, `facial hair below chin` IS FALSE, `facial hair continuous` IS TRUE)
-- L4 oracle ==> TRUE

-- long, but nowhere the Act names
#EVAL `bearded` (Person WITH `facial hair length mm` IS 20, `facial hair on chin` IS FALSE, `facial hair below chin` IS FALSE, `facial hair continuous` IS FALSE)
-- L4 oracle ==> FALSE
